{"family": "B-28", "cause_key": "setting-switches-never-flipped", "cause": "Settings are read once at start and no test flips them on and off (or while a screen is open) and checks the effect.", "members": ["FN-A8-panel-ui-shell-1-02", "FN-A8-phone-components-2-3-05", "FN-A8-phone-lib-core-2-09", "FN-A8-phone-native-2-06", "FN-A8-phone-onboarding-db-3-06", "FN-A8-phone-screens-2-3-01", "FN-A8-phone-tracker-components-2-2-13", "FN-A8-phone-tracker-components-2-2-14", "FN-A8-phone-tracker-services-2-1-05"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["panel", "phone"], "guard": "Each setting gets a test that flips it both ways, including while the affected screen is open, and checks the effect.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-29", "cause_key": "audit-log-rows-never-read-back", "cause": "Privileged actions write log rows but tests never read them back, and one action writes none.", "members": ["FN-A8-hq-app-1-02", "FN-A8-server-database-1-1-05", "FN-A8-server-database-1-3-06", "FN-A8-server-database-1-3-10", "FN-A8-server-database-1-4-01", "FN-A8-server-hq-gate-workers-2-01", "FN-A8-server-hq-gate-workers-2-07", "FN-A8-server-panel-worker-3-03"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["hq", "server"], "guard": "Every privileged action test reads back its log row (who, what, masked fields), and a check fails for an action with no log line.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-30", "cause_key": "words-claim-what-is-not-true", "cause": "Screen words are written as fixed promises instead of being driven by the real state, so they claim things that are not true (saved, safe, a button that does not exist, a fixed 15 minutes).", "members": ["FN-A8-phone-cloud-backup-ai-1-01", "FN-A8-phone-cloud-backup-ai-1-02", "FN-A8-phone-components-1-1-02", "FN-A8-phone-onboarding-db-1-01", "FN-A8-phone-tracker-components-1-1-01", "FN-A8-phone-tracker-engine-2-01", "FN-A8-server-database-2-1-01", "FN-A8-web-pages-2-06"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["panel", "phone", "web"], "guard": "Any line that states a fact (saved, safe, wait N minutes, works in pounds) must be fed by the state it describes, with a test of the failing state.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-31", "cause_key": "automatic-jobs-untested", "cause": "Nightly clean-ups, scheduled runs and automatic starts are tested, if at all, on one row and only when every step works.", "members": ["FN-A8-phone-cloud-backup-ai-1-07", "FN-A8-server-database-1-4-02", "FN-A8-server-database-3-1-02", "FN-A8-server-database-3-2-02", "FN-A8-server-hq-gate-workers-1-02", "FN-A8-server-hq-gate-workers-3-02", "FN-A8-server-panel-worker-3-01"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["phone", "server"], "guard": "Each scheduled job gets a test that plants old and edge rows of every kind it touches and makes one early step fail.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-32", "cause_key": "cloud-relay-and-public-addresses-untested", "cause": "The public gym-server addresses and relay pass-through are tested only for their main page, not headers, unknown addresses or upgrades.", "members": ["FN-A8-server-panel-worker-1-01", "FN-A8-server-panel-worker-1-07", "FN-A8-server-panel-worker-1-08", "FN-A8-server-panel-worker-2-03", "FN-A8-web-pages-1-01", "FN-A8-web-pages-1-03", "FN-A8-web-pages-1-09"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["server", "web"], "guard": "An address test that sends each public address an unknown path, a live-update upgrade and checks the safety headers.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-33", "cause_key": "gym-switch-leaves-old-gym-state", "cause": "Gym-scoped data on the phone (logo, look, kept plan, hours, sync, what is sent) has no single owner, and no test moves a member from gym A to gym B.", "members": ["FN-A8-phone-components-1-1-05", "FN-A8-phone-lib-core-2-07", "FN-A8-phone-shop-1-1-02", "FN-A8-phone-shop-1-2-03", "FN-A8-phone-shop-2-1-03", "FN-A8-phone-shop-2-3-05", "FN-A8-phone-tracker-lib-1-04"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["phone"], "guard": "One gym-switch test that joins gym A, switches to gym B and checks every gym-scoped store, header and outgoing call shows only gym B.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-34", "cause_key": "sales-demo-never-driven", "cause": "The sales demo's pretend server is never exercised by pressing buttons, so its acted-out actions, refusals, badges and reset are unchecked.", "members": ["FN-A8-panel-brand-shell-1-07", "FN-A8-panel-demo-1-01", "FN-A8-panel-demo-1-02", "FN-A8-panel-demo-1-03", "FN-A8-panel-demo-1-04", "FN-A8-panel-demo-1-06", "FN-A8-panel-demo-1-07"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["panel"], "guard": "A demo walk test that presses every acted-out action and one refused action per page and compares badges with cards.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-35", "cause_key": "input-dropped-silently", "cause": "Rules trim, cut or leave out what a person typed or chose without saying so, and tests lock that silence in.", "members": ["FN-A8-panel-forms-1-07", "FN-A8-panel-logic-1-4-01", "FN-A8-phone-tracker-components-1-2-02", "FN-A8-server-database-3-3-01"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["panel", "phone"], "guard": "No rule may drop or cut input without a visible line; a shared check flags any trim or filter that has no message.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-36", "cause_key": "server-answers-not-shaped-by-role", "cause": "Server reads return the same answer to every caller instead of shaping it by who asks, so the desk or a stranger learns more than their role should.", "members": ["FN-A8-panel-shop-1-03", "FN-A8-panel-shop-1-04", "FN-A8-server-database-2-2-01"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["panel", "server"], "guard": "A role-by-function access matrix test that calls every read as owner, desk, trainer and stranger and checks the exact fields returned.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-37", "cause_key": "alerts-keyed-by-count", "cause": "New-question and message alerts compare counts instead of ids, so a question that arrives just after another is answered makes no sound.", "members": ["FN-A8-panel-logic-2-1-03"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["panel"], "guard": "Alerts track waiting items by their own id, with a swap test.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-38", "cause_key": "pt-booking-limit-only-on-screen", "cause": "The rule that a member needs classes left is checked only on the screen, so the server books personal training with none left.", "members": ["FN-A8-panel-ui-shell-4-01"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["panel"], "guard": "Every limit a screen enforces is also enforced and tested on the server.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-39", "cause_key": "receipt-history-kept-not-shown", "cause": "The server keeps a history of receipt changes that no screen ever shows the owner.", "members": ["FN-A8-server-database-1-2-02"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["server"], "guard": "Every record the server keeps for the owner has a screen or a journey saying why not.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-40", "cause_key": "restore-revives-deleted-accounts", "cause": "Restoring a backup brings back members who deleted their account since it was taken, and nothing re-deletes them.", "members": ["FN-A8-server-database-2-3-01"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["server"], "guard": "The restore guide and drill re-apply account deletions logged after the backup, with a test.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-41", "cause_key": "whats-new-dates-without-year", "cause": "What's new dates are stored without a year, so new-feature dots come back a year later.", "members": ["FN-A8-phone-components-1-1-01"], "worst": "S3", "surfaces": ["phone"], "guard": "Every stored date carries its year; a test checks an old note never shows a dot.", "lane": "standard"}
{"family": "B-42", "cause_key": "hq-key-request-no-time-limit", "cause": "The alerts key request to HQ has no time limit, so a slow HQ hangs it.", "members": ["FN-A8-server-panel-worker-3-07"], "worst": "S4", "surfaces": ["server"], "guard": "Every server-to-server call has a time limit, checked by a lint and a slow-answer test.", "lane": "full"}
{"family": "B-43", "cause_key": "note-name-line-hidden-for-all", "cause": "The rule that hides a note line repeating the workout name, meant for imported workouts, runs on every workout and hides the member's own first line.", "members": ["FN-A8-phone-tracker-lib-2-02"], "worst": "S4", "surfaces": ["phone"], "guard": "The hide rule is limited to imported workouts and tested on a typed note.", "lane": "standard"}
